IgdGock1m8g5nPl_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlQGN8xvu7-g0yXimmmzib6IR1-BMEhsHyp2f8DYNfJw&oe=6AF9EB6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zombies", "keywords": ["zombie", "shooter", "undead", "ragdoll", "shoot"], "long_description": "Step into a zombie sandbox shooter where physics-driven gameplay, a full-body controller system, and stylized action come together. Experiment freely with a wide variety of weapons as zombies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in chaotic, physics-based encounters.\n{1274756444826142}\nPlayers can physically grab, aim, reload, and swap weapons with intuitive motion controls, creating a realistic firefight experience that feels natural and engaging. Enjoy precise two-handed rifle support with smooth recoil feedback and interactive magazine mechanics.\n{1639174897351635}\nEnemies are fully ragdolled and react dynamically to damage. Shoot off limbs and watch zombies adapt. Losing legs forces them to crawl. Instead of realistic horror, the game embraces a stylized, exaggerated visual style with non-realistic blood effects designed to keep the experience fun and accessible rather than disturbing.\n\nBuilt as a sandbox, the game encourages experimentation. Test different weapons, and explore how enemies respond to physics-driven destruction. Every encounter becomes a small simulation where movement, impact, and environment all matter.\n\nThis gamefocuses on replayability, physical interaction, and satisfying VR feedback loops.\n\n", "short_description": "A zombie shooter sandbox featuring ragdoll physics, a full-body VR controller, modular weapon support, and stylized combat effects. Experiment with a wide range of weapons while enemies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in a fun way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://molancegames.com/privacy-policy-3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "pub